<title>USA: Hudson to buy back up to 100,000 more shrs.</title>
<headline>Hudson to buy back up to 100,000 more shrs.</headline>
<dateline>GREAT NECK, N.Y. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson General Corp on Friday said it planned to buy back up to an additional 100,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases are to take place from time to time either on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Since December 1, the company has repurchased 142,000 shares in the open market. Under previous authorizations, Hudson General still has the authority to buy back 93,700 shares, it said.</p>
<p>Hudson General, through its subsidiaries, provides various services at airports throughout the United States and Canada.</p>
</text>
